  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting inclusive job creation and MSMEs competitiveness through cluster development to spur post war recovery and reconstruction in the Regional State of Tigray (Ethiopia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bureau of Industry of the Interim Regional Administration of Tigray has sent an official request to UNIDO to strengthen MSMEs co mpetitiveness and employment creation through cluster development. A first concept note that has been prepared by UNIDO to support cluster development in the metal works, textile and garment, cactus and honey sectors has already been approved in principle by the Head of the Bureau of Industry of the Interim Regional Administration of Tigray.</narrative>
  </description>
